5,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I want to know exactly how much everything costs from the start! No surprises later, okay?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Cost is fine, but I'm more concerned about the logistics. I'm tired of wasting half the trip just moving.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Rin. We need a clear financial structure. I want to avoid any ambiguous payment arrangements this year.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I don't care about the money. I just want to know if we'll be crammed together or if there's actual space.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Space is important, but so is the quality of our time. I want to understand the balance of our interactions.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if we find a place with an all-in rate, it's easier for everyone!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"All-in rates are convenient, but they don't fix the issue of spending ten hours on a train.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, all-in rates are indeed the most logical way to ensure no one is left out of pocket.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, if the travel is fast, we have more time to actually relax. I hate feeling rushed.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, relaxation depends on the environment. I'm curious about how the layout affects our mood.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,Let's check the all-in rates and the house pricing first!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll look into the transport. I want to see if we can actually optimize the travel time this year.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will investigate the pricing of the offshore houses and the all-in rates to ensure financial transparency.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm looking into the bathroom stuff and the meal times. I can't stand strict schedules or crowded baths.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the time we spent alone last year and how the days actually ran.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
