60,3,1,talk,Rin,,"I vote for the Island Trip! One house, one price, and it sounds like a big adventure!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Absolutely not. The ferry schedule is a waste of our limited time. I'm voting for the City Break.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,The City Break is a financial nightmare for group accounting. The Island Trip is the most logically sound for payments.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm voting for the City Break. I can't do a shared room or a single bathroom for five people.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"The Island Trip risks the ""crowded"" feeling, while the City Break risks the ""alone"" feeling. The Hot Spring Town is the balance.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, but the Hot Spring Town has those strict meal times! That's not an adventure!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, you can use an app to split costs. It's better than spending two days on a boat.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,Apps are for those who forget to track. A fixed house price is a structural solution. I vote Island Trip.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, the Hot Spring Town is just a different kind of cage. I need my own space to breathe.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, a little structure prevents the drift we had last year. I vote for the Hot Spring Town.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,"Please, let's go to the island! It's the most exciting and the bill is the easiest!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,Excitement isn't worth the exhaustion of transit. City Break is the only rational choice for efficiency.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I've made my decision. The Island Trip ensures no one is quietly out of pocket.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm not compromising on sleep. City Break is the only way I won't be counting the days.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I believe the Hot Spring Town allows us to be together without being trapped. It's the most sustainable choice.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
